STATEMENT OF MODIFICATIONS
--------------------------
As required by section 3(a)(1)(B) of CC-BY-SA-4.0, the following changes were
made to the original material:

  * EAGLE packages (adafruit.lbr) were mechanically converted to KiCad 8
    footprint files (.kicad_mod) by tools/eagle2kicad.py in this repository.
  * EAGLE devicesets and symbols were converted to a KiCad 8 symbol library
    (.kicad_sym), one symbol per deviceset/device variant, with pin numbers
    resolved from the EAGLE <connect> elements.
  * Coordinates were mirrored in Y for footprints, because KiCad board
    coordinates increase downward while EAGLE's increase upward.
  * Octagonal pads were converted to circular pads; KiCad has no octagon pad
    primitive.
  * Copper keepout geometry on EAGLE layers 41, 42 and 43 was dropped.
  * From each product board file, tools/brd2module.py extracted only the
    board outline, mounting holes, non-plated holes, the through-hole pads of
    header and terminal-block packages, and connector outlines, and wrote them
    as one KiCad footprint centred on the outline; pads were renumbered 1..N
    with the original net name kept as the pad's pin function. A schematic
    symbol with the same pin numbers and names was generated from that list.
    All other board content (components, copper, silkscreen) was omitted.
  * No part was redrawn, retuned or dimensionally altered by hand.

This derivative was not produced by, reviewed by, or endorsed by Adafruit
Industries.

